+# Tests
+
+Conventions for this package:
+
+1. Tests use the real in-memory store from `makeStore()` (`src/store.js`), never a hand-written stand-in.
+2. Outbound email is asserted on `makeFakeMailer().sent` (`test/helpers.js`), because the message sent is the outcome.
+3. Test through the public API. Fields and methods whose names start with `_` are private.
+4. Freeze time with `mock.timers` from `node:test`; no test depends on the real clock.
+
+Run the suite with `npm test`.
